      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm encountering this on VRCSDK3-WORLD-2020.12.09.04.44_Public \nI've made a prefab that reproduces this issue, here: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1bbcG4g4d_0kNOv3wsSVuvViwXE_lZXxK/view?usp=sharing\nSteps to repro:\n1. Execute script with an Update event\n2. make a graph that connects at least two Branch nodes together\n3. put a third branch node in front of that graph, sending the execution flow through the False output",
